# stoop — secrets.
#
# The Deploy to Cloudflare button asks for every uncommented name in this file.
# For `wrangler dev`, copy it to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill it in. For a
# deployed Worker set the same names with `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>` instead.
# Never commit real values.

# --- Admin access (REQUIRED) ------------------------------------------------
# Gates /admin/* (API keys, audit log, status) and the OAuth approval screen.
# Use a long random passphrase.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=""
# Signs the /admin session cookie and the approval form. 32 random bytes, hex:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
COOKIE_SIGNING_KEY=""

# --- API keys ---------------------------------------------------------------
# There is no secret for these. Sign in at /admin/keys and mint one; the worker
# stores its SHA-256 in the store Durable Object and shows you the key once.

# --- Upstream provider (REQUIRED for the default, zyte) --------------------
# zyte: https://www.zyte.com/ → API key
ZYTE_API_KEY=""

# Other providers, if you change UPSTREAM_PROVIDER in wrangler.jsonc. Uncomment
# the ones you use.
# brightdata: Web Unlocker API token (zone name is the BRIGHTDATA_ZONE var)
# BRIGHTDATA_API_KEY=""
# relay: your own relay (scripts/relay.mjs) on a residential connection
# RELAY_URL=""
# RELAY_TOKEN=""

# --- Optional ----------------------------------------------------------------
# NYC Open Data app token: raises Socrata rate limits. https://data.cityofnewyork.us/profile/edit/developer_settings
# SOCRATA_APP_TOKEN=""
